WEBVTT

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.810
I heard Eren's voice just now!

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:30.720
My name is Eren Yeager.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:36.950
I'm using the power of the Founding Titan
to address all Subjects of Ymir.

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:42.300
I've undone the hardening of
all the Walls on Paradis island,

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:46.590
and all Titans entrapped within
them have started marching.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:51.270
My goal is to protect
the people of Paradis,

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:54.400
the place I was born and raised.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.240
However, the world...

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:01.370
...wishes for the annihilation of
the people of Paradis.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.990
Not just the people of this island,

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:08.120
but until all of the Subjects of Ymir
have been eliminated.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.710
I reject that wish.

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:14.840
The Wall Titans...

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:19.220
...shall trample all surface of the land
outside of this island.

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:22.470
Until all lives existing there...

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:25.680
...have been exterminated from this world.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:30.380
Rumbling, Rumbling, it's coming

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:33.290
Rumbling, Rumbling

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:36.260
Beware

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:42.680
Coming for you

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:50.650
All I ever wanted to do was do right things

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:55.320
I've never wanted to be the king, I swear

00:01:56.940 --> 00:02:00.280
All I ever wanted to do was save your life

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:05.410
I've never wanted to grab a knife, I swear

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:13.840
Tearless, fearless, burning, burning

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:17.090
You tell me what have I missed

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:20.680
Still wandering in the deep mist

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:26.720
If I lose it all, slip and fall

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:29.560
I will never look away

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:35.480
If I lose it all, lose it all, lose it all

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:39.400
If I lose it all outside the wall

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:42.740
Live to die another day

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:45.120
I don't want anything

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:48.500
I'm just here to...

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:52.540
Beware

00:02:57.030 --> 00:03:02.030
(Thaw)

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:15.160
What? What was that strange place?

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.800
Are you okay, Mr. Leonhart?

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.950
Say... did you hear it?

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:26.550
The Titans are coming from
that island to kill us...

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:35.050
Falco!

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:37.640
Falco!

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:38.930
Where are you?

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:40.730
Where did you go?

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:44.940
When someone shifted into
a Titan for the first time...

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:48.230
It affects their memories and
he wouldn't be able to move right away.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.280
They took him away.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:53.000
By who? And why?

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:56.770
It's probably Jean and Connie.

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:02.290
There's no way they would leave
someone as crucial as Falco behind...

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:08.030
They won't just let one of
the Nine Titans go free...

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:11.470
Reiner!

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:13.470
Did you get injured somewhere?

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:14.670
Yeah...

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:17.720
For some reason, my armor
was stripped away...

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:20.970
and I took a direct hit from
the wall debris...

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:27.610
I couldn't stop him.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:34.460
Eren... will destroy the world.

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:51.310
There's an airship
for evacuation in the south.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:56.380
Find Pieck or other Marleyan soldiers
and make your way there.

00:04:58.170 --> 00:04:59.760
You must tell them.

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:01.640
Tell Marley...

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.060
No, the whole world...

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:07.810
What will that make?

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:09.460
Where can we run?

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.190
My dad, my mom...

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:17.210
Even Aunt Karina, everyone's
going to die, aren't they?

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:20.340
That's right.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.420
We must kill Eren and stop this!

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:24.200
It's impossible.

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:28.920
The Founding Titan can control
all Titans and Subjects of Ymir...

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:32.030
...as however it sees fit.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:38.410
No one can stop him now...

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:43.310
All we can do is to run away...

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:47.270
Reiner...

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:58.570
I'm not giving up.

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:04.550
Wait for me, Falco.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.410
It's finished.

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:20.590
I never thought he'd planned to
slaughter everyone outside the walls.

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:26.270
But if those people are gone,
so will all the hatred they have.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:31.590
All the enemies that ever threatened
our existence will be smushed to death.

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:34.690
Leaving nothing but
a blank, empty land.

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:40.460
The thing people beyond the ocean
feared the most has happened.

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:47.270
Because they deemed us as devils
and tried to kill us all.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:50.410
So this...

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:54.050
This is what those people
brought on themselves.

00:06:55.070 --> 00:06:57.760
There was nothing we can do about it.

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:58.860
Isn't that right?

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:02.590
But...

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:04.350
This...

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:07.260
This is too far.

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:10.510
This is an unprecedented
level of genocide.

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:12.410
Then...

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:14.620
...Will you stop him?

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:16.110
Stop Eren?

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:23.940
Eren rejected Zeke's idea to
castrate us with his Euthanasia plan.

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:27.250
He also rejected the idea
to sacrifice Historia

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:29.930
to maintain control over
the power of the Founding.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.370
In other words...

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:33.970
Eren...

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:38.950
He sacrificed the humanity
beyond the walls to protect us.

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:42.850
The ones who'll benefit
from this genocide...

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.300
...are us.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:48.100
You guys are important to me.

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:50.010
More than anyone else.

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:05.530
What's that?

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:09.450
The Titans... are fighting our soldiers?

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:12.100
Did they devour all
the Marleyan soldiers?

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:14.080
No way.

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:16.080
If Eren has control
over the Founding Titan,

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.550
he should be able to
control all the Titans!

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:20.300
But they're eating our comrades!

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:21.170
We must help them!

00:08:21.170 --> 00:08:22.340
Jean, wait!

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:25.120
What are you going
to do with that boy?

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:30.820
He probably inherited the Jaw Titan.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.520
We can't just let him be.

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:36.310
And we can at least save somebody
who's turned into a Titan

00:08:36.310 --> 00:08:37.690
by feeding this boy to him.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:40.980
Like Commander Pixis--

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:41.990
No.

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:44.750
My mom.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:47.450
We'll feed him to
my mom in Ragako village.

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:50.600
All right?

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:55.080
Connie, Jean.

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:59.000
According to Zeke,
that boy is a Warrior Candidate,

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:01.630
and he's loved by Reiner
and those in Warrior Unit.

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:05.220
If we were to kill someone
close to them like him...

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:08.730
it'd provoke a whole new conflict
with Riner and the Cart Titan.

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:11.220
If Marley's done for,

00:09:11.220 --> 00:09:15.020
there's no point in continuing
our blood feud with Reiner and others.

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:15.640
So--

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:18.150
You're saying my mom doesn't matter?

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:19.980
That's not what I--

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:24.110
Do you even know how I feel going
back to my village again and again...

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:26.270
just to see my mom being like that?!

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:30.320
You're alive right now because
you ate Bertolt, aren't you?!

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:33.210
Don't stop me from bringing
back my mom to life--

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.270
Connie!

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:43.020
Hey!

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:44.670
Connie!

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:45.630
Hold it!

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:48.120
This is bad!

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.630
We need to deal with these Titans first!

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:53.300
There aren't any walls
left on this island!

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:59.670
This is bad.
They'll destroy this fort too!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.240
Did they eat all the soldiers outside?

00:10:01.270 --> 00:10:02.970
Yelena, get back!

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:05.780
Those are the Titans Zeke created...

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:06.820
Huh?

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:09.410
Why...

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:13.160
Why is Zeke not controlling them?

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:24.550
They're here!

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:30.640
It's... over...

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:35.140
Run! Get to a narrow alley!

00:10:40.690 --> 00:10:42.150
Kaya! Look in front of you!

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:47.190
- Kaya!
- No, Mr. Blouse!

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:00.770
Why...

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:02.720
Again...

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:11.970
Save me...

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:13.240
Sasha...

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:15.810
Kaya!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.240
Kaya! Get up!

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:56.520
Sasha...?

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.980
I heard you escaped
with the Warrior Unit.

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:13.030
What are you doing here?

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:15.370
They captured Falco and
I came back to rescue him.

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:16.570
You mean Ben?

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:19.240
Hey! Are you all okay?

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:21.210
Did you kill that Titan?

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:23.870
What's that weapon?

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:25.340
Did that girl do it?

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:27.630
Could it be...

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:29.650
Are you the intruder kid from Marley?!

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:34.840
Tell us!

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:36.140
Or else...

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:37.210
She's not!

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:40.690
We're all family!
We live in the stables together!

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:42.400
Kaya...

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:45.390
I'm the one who killed the Titan!

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:48.730
I used to be Marleyan soldier and a POW,
so I know how to use this gun!

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:53.240
Please forget about that
and take us to safety!

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.900
Save us, Mister Soldier!

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:56.610
Please! We beg you!

00:12:58.390 --> 00:12:59.700
You guys...

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:04.580
Okay.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:06.260
Let's make our way around the flame.

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.210
Listen, Mia.

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:11.380
Get Ben and run.

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:15.510
Stay with us and be good
until then, okay?

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.070
Yes.

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:22.720
Did all of you also have that daydream?

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:24.060
Yes.

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:28.150
Are the Titans of the Walls really
going out into the world?

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.120
Yeah, seems like it.

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:35.500
Why...

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:37.910
...did you defend me?

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:41.090
The same goes for you.

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.930
Why did you save me?

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:47.130
You even risked your life.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.340
I don't know.

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:54.380
I tried to kill you.

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:57.910
I'm a devil, aren't I?

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:02.350
No.

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:04.610
I'm the devil.

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:09.240
I've killed a lot of people.

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:11.690
So that people would praise me.

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:16.130
That's the devil within me.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:20.070
He's inside of me as well.

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:23.910
Be it Kaya or everyone else...

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:28.630
There's a devil inside us all,
that's why the world turned out this way.

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:32.040
Then what should we do?

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.870
We must get out of this forest.

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:37.940
Even if we can't...

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:40.610
We must keep trying.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.910
- Save me!
- Surma!

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:57.490
Surma!

00:14:58.360 --> 00:15:03.770
I don't recall ever teaching you to
whimper on the ground in face of a Titan!

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:06.700
Put on your Vertical Maneuver Gear!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:08.770
We've got some old units left!

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.540
Follow me!

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:14.090
That is if any of you want to survive!

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:16.430
Instructor Shadis!

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:34.210
Are there any surviving soldiers?!

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:37.280
All of you, move to
the top floor of the fort!

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:39.700
We'll gather the Titans there
and take them out!

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:42.490
Get all the Thunder Spears you have!

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:44.450
We'll handle the rest!

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:46.990
Don't let the Titans go anywhere else!

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:49.540
If you care about your friends
who've been turned into Titans...

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:51.940
Put them to rest here
and end their misery!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.130
Let's go all at once!

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:11.420
FIRE!

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:23.870
They are here!

00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:24.980
Pull back!

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:29.040
This way!

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:30.080
Yes, sir!

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:32.540
You guys don't have to fight!

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.040
Just lure them to the fort!

00:16:59.470 --> 00:17:01.260
Commander Pixis...

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:18.330
Let's do this.

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:23.260
Commander...

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:27.860
We've made it this far all thanks to you.

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:35.860
Rest... in peace.

00:18:29.530 --> 00:18:31.550
The flames finally began to settle.

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:35.240
The Marleyan soldiers have
been mostly wiped out.

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:37.920
And the Pure Titans are all gone.

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:41.080
This place's safe for now.

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:42.220
I see...

00:18:44.550 --> 00:18:48.630
Could you now tell us about
this daydream you guys had?

00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:52.360
What is Eren doing right now?

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:55.240
Exactly as it looks like.

00:18:57.560 --> 00:18:58.730
I see...

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:04.630
Is my homeland dommed, as well?

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.200
Floch!

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:10.350
Are you okay?

00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:14.950
So, I heard while I was busy dying
as the walls came down,

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:18.160
you're the one who led
the Titan hunt, Jean?

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:20.430
So you're alive.

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.790
Yeah, thanks for your concern.

00:19:23.990 --> 00:19:26.500
But I can't die just yet.

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:30.060
Not during the moment
of the Eldian empire's return.

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:38.210
Yelena.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.520
Gather the Volunteers.

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:42.110
You're all under arrest.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:43.840
What?

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:49.210
I'm glad you're fine, Mr. Blouse.

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:52.000
I feel the same about you.

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:55.660
But sorry for calling
you during all of this.

00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:57.710
You...

00:19:57.740 --> 00:19:58.880
Why are you here?

00:19:58.900 --> 00:20:00.380
Please believe me.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:02.120
I don't want to fight anymore.

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:06.800
I just want you to give Falco back.

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:10.310
I promise we will be gone after that!

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:16.660
Where is... Falco?

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:22.770
No way...

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:26.980
He kidnapped him to feed him
to his mother who's been turned into a Titan?

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:28.080
Why?

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:34.030
Connie's mother was the only Titan
that can't move, so she is still there.

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:38.830
Connie has been taking care of
his mother for four years...

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:40.200
The incident four years ago...?

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:47.960
I-I'm... sorry...

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:54.590
Even so... I still can't give up on Falco.

00:20:56.640 --> 00:21:01.770
Hey, can't Eren Yeager turn Connie's
mother back into a human?

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:04.600
The Founding Titan can do anything, right?

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:06.850
I don't know...

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:08.480
But if Eren could do that...

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:13.280
I think Eren would have turned the soldiers
transformed by Zeke back into humans.

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:16.570
If you don't know,
then go ask Eren directly!

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:20.240
Does he really have to kill
everyone outside of the island?

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:22.620
He doesn't have to do that, right?

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:26.210
Can't he just attack all
military facilities in the world?

00:21:26.210 --> 00:21:27.790
Go ask him!

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:31.770
He even stripped Riner's armor!
He should be able to do it!

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:34.050
Where is Reiner now?

00:21:34.050 --> 00:21:36.090
That doesn't matter right now!

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:37.890
He's heavily injured
and can't move anyway!

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:40.430
The Armored Titan's hardening
was undone?

00:21:40.430 --> 00:21:42.550
When? At what moment?

00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:46.190
As the walls fell...

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:48.940
Armin?

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:50.980
Eren said...

00:21:51.520 --> 00:21:55.430
That he has undone all the hardening...

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:13.150
The iron bullet is the proof of justice

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:15.730
If it pierces through,
I'll be closer to being a hero

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:18.450
But when I close my eyes and touch

00:22:18.450 --> 00:22:22.990
I notice that the devil
was no different from me

00:22:23.780 --> 00:22:26.450
Why am I not good, but he's okay?

00:22:26.450 --> 00:22:29.160
The only thing that
separates us was the wall

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:31.830
Don't lament on the fate that we're born

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:35.710
Because we're all free

00:22:35.710 --> 00:22:40.970
If only I have wings like birds

00:22:40.970 --> 00:22:46.310
I can go anywhere I want

00:22:46.310 --> 00:22:50.390
But if I don't have a place to return to

00:22:50.390 --> 00:22:55.820
I'm sure I can't go anywhere

00:22:55.820 --> 00:23:00.780
I don't want to just live

00:23:01.160 --> 00:23:11.830
The world is cruel, but I still love you

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:21.930
I will sacrifice anything to protect you

00:23:21.930 --> 00:23:27.140
Even if it's a mistake to do so,
I'll not doubt my actions

00:23:27.140 --> 00:23:33.560
Because the right thing
is to firmly believe in yourself

00:23:41.180 --> 00:23:44.510
She was once an ally and an enemy.

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:48.510
The frozen time finally moves again,
but everything had changed.

00:23:48.970 --> 00:23:51.840
At the end of it all,
what choice will she make?

00:23:52.100 --> 00:23:54.690
Next time, \"Sunset.\"
